From 6da12381e1c5ee715bde941a6e8a2a3dc8430ec2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 17:44:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Boot straight to the login screen

The splash gated navigation on an intro video finishing: 9.8s of footage at
1.5x playback, so ~6.5s before a driver could reach login on every cold
start. It also waited on a settings fetch that the router already handles.

GoRouter's redirect already resolves session, maintenance mode and blocked
state on its own; the splash route was excluded from it by an early return.
Starting at /login lets that logic run instead. Maintenance mode still
diverts once settings resolve, via the existing settings listenable.

Drops video_player and the splash assets, which nothing else referenced.
